    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_fertilizers_animal_materials; processing_state=unspecified; wd_term=ivory; wd_relation=skos:broadMatch): 'Teeth: Elephants, Sea Cow and Sea Horses' is ivory by weight (cwt; origins Egypt, South Africa, Malta), the same commodity as htc:0224/htc:0609; classifier matched 'horses' and filed it as live draft animals. Layer-1 observations: 41 rows, 1822–1876. Series: HCPP_Annual Statement of Trade ×38; KEW_CUST 4 ×3. Units: CWTS (Hundredweights) ×38; Hundredweights.Quarters.Pounds ×2; (no unit) ×1. Top routes: World → United Kingdom ×3; British Possessions in South Africa → United Kingdom ×3; Egypt → United Kingdom ×3; Malta → United Kingdom ×3."@en ;
